## Grid
<svg aria-label="Integer point grid" class="zen-math-viewport" data-render-mode="points" data-visible-count="100" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" role="group" tabindex="0" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" @pointerdown=down @pointermove=move @pointerup=up @pointercancel=cancel @lostpointercapture=cancel @pointerleave=leave @wheel=wheel @keydown=key>
  <title>
    "Integer point grid"
  <desc>
    "Hover to inspect, click to pin. Drag to pan; scroll to zoom at the pointer. Plus and minus zoom, arrows move selection, Home fits, Escape clears the pin. Density cells summarize multiple objects; click a cell to zoom."
